Provenance note (added by this project, not part of the licence text)

The upstream release archive (Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21278793,
`pamela-publish-code.zip`) does **not** contain a LICENSE file or a copyright
line. The licence is established by two independent upstream statements:

  * the Zenodo record's licence field — `license.id = "mit-license"`
    (verified 2026-08-14 via https://zenodo.org/api/records/21278793)
  * the upstream `package.json`, which declares `"license": "MIT"`

The text above is therefore the standard MIT template with the copyright line
filled in from the Zenodo record's sole creator ("Bruckner, Tomáš"). It is
reproduced here so that copies of this repository carry the notice MIT
requires — it is **not** a verbatim copy of an upstream file, because no such
file was published.
